Model "namespace_example".

"ec0" is an object [role: ec, id: core://core/execution_context/ec0::main_loop_ec, name: ec0, type: main_loop_ec, rate: 1].
"ec0" can be stopped or started.
"ec0" is initially started.

"ec0 cycle" is a process [role: ec_cycle].
"ec0 cycle" occurs if "ec0" is started, otherwise "ec0 cycle" is skipped.
"ec0 cycle" invokes "robot1/talker0" [order: 0].
"ec0 cycle" invokes "robot2/talker0" [order: 1].
"ec0 cycle" invokes itself.

"namespace_example" is an object [role: system, name: namespace_example].
"namespace_example" consists of "ec0".
"namespace_example" consists of "robot1/chatter".
"namespace_example" consists of "robot2/chatter".
"namespace_example" exhibits "robot1/listener0".
"namespace_example" exhibits "robot1/talker0".
"namespace_example" exhibits "robot2/listener0".
"namespace_example" exhibits "robot2/talker0".

"robot1/chatter" is an object [role: topic, name: chatter, namespace: robot1].

"robot1/listener0" is a process [role: process, id: core://core/process/robot1/listener0::listener_python, name: listener0, namespace: robot1, type: listener_python, use_memo: false].
"robot1/listener0" yields "robot1/listener0 out".
"robot1/chatter" initiates "robot1/listener0", which requires "robot1/chatter" [arg: arg1, arg_index: 0].

"robot1/listener0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

"robot1/talker0" is a process [role: process, id: core://core/process/robot1/talker0::talker_python, name: talker0, namespace: robot1, type: talker_python, use_memo: false].
"robot1/talker0" yields "robot1/chatter".
"robot1/talker0" yields "robot1/talker0 out".
"robot1/talker0" requires "robot1/talker0 message" [arg: message, arg_index: 0].

"robot1/talker0 message" is an object [role: value, value_kind: input, default: "Hello, World!"].

"robot1/talker0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

"robot2/chatter" is an object [role: topic, name: chatter, namespace: robot2].

"robot2/listener0" is a process [role: process, id: core://core/process/robot2/listener0::listener_python, name: listener0, namespace: robot2, type: listener_python, use_memo: false].
"robot2/listener0" yields "robot2/listener0 out".
"robot2/chatter" initiates "robot2/listener0", which requires "robot2/chatter" [arg: arg1, arg_index: 0].

"robot2/listener0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

"robot2/talker0" is a process [role: process, id: core://core/process/robot2/talker0::talker_python, name: talker0, namespace: robot2, type: talker_python, use_memo: false].
"robot2/talker0" yields "robot2/chatter".
"robot2/talker0" yields "robot2/talker0 out".
"robot2/talker0" requires "robot2/talker0 message" [arg: message, arg_index: 0].

"robot2/talker0 message" is an object [role: value, value_kind: input, default: "Hello, World!"].

"robot2/talker0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].
